{#- WEBSITE › SHARING — what of Thauma's appears on other websites, laid out
   as the staff Sharing page is (Chase, 2026-10-27: "Admin Updates and
   Sharing operate differently from staff … Events and Resources don't have
   the Sharing visualizers anywhere"). Its four on the left, the real thing
   in the middle at a desktop's or a phone's width in any language, and on
   the right what decides whether it is out, what it says and the code to
   paste.

   EVENTS AND RESOURCES are shared while their page is on thauma.one (the
   site writes them out with its pages, _data/thaumaEmbed.js); there is no
   switch of their own, so this says which it is and where the page's is.

   THE TWO FORMS are thauma.one's own (hand-built into its pages, their words
   site words in Site Creator) and the same forms pasted anywhere else (their
   words below). What a message does — where it goes, who it is sent as, the
   reasons, which lists — is the same for both. The working copy waits for
   Save, like the rest of the console. -#}
<div class="wf sh-page" id="wfRoot">
  <p class="rolegate" id="wfProblem" hidden></p>

  <div class="sh-grid">
    <nav class="sh-list" id="wfList" aria-label="What is shared"></nav>

    <div class="sh-mid">
      <div class="emb-stagebar">
        <div class="emb-devices" role="tablist" aria-label="Width">
          <button type="button" class="emb-device is-on" role="tab" aria-selected="true"
                  data-wf-width="wide" data-i18n="emb.desktop">Desktop</button>
          <button type="button" class="emb-device" role="tab" aria-selected="false"
                  data-wf-width="narrow" data-i18n="emb.mobile">Mobile</button>
        </div>
        <span class="emb-scale-note" id="wfScaleNote"></span>
        <span class="c-gap"></span>
        <span class="sh-picks">
          {#- Its place on thauma.one, or Other Websites (admin-forms.js). -#}
          <label class="sh-pick"><span data-i18n="sh.shownOn">Shown On</span>
            <select id="wfWhere"></select></label>
          <label class="sh-pick"><span data-i18n="emb.lang">Language</span>
            <select id="wfLang"></select></label>
        </span>
      </div>
      <div class="emb-stage" id="wfStage">
        <div class="emb-scale" id="wfScale">
          <iframe id="wfFrame" title="Preview" sandbox="allow-scripts"></iframe>
        </div>
      </div>

      {#- The words a pasted form carries, in every language. thauma.one's own
         form speaks its page's words; this is for everywhere else. -#}
      <div class="sh-card sh-words" id="wfWords" hidden>
        <span class="sh-lbl" data-i18n="wf.wordsElsewhere">Its Words on Other Websites</span>
        <div class="ms-writing wf-writing" id="wfWritingRow">
          <label class="ms-pick"><span data-i18n="con.editing">Editing</span>
            <select id="wfWriting" class="lang-pick" data-lang-edit></select></label>
          <span class="lang-ref" id="wfBesideWrap">
            <button type="button" class="lang-swap" data-lang-swap data-i18n-attr="aria-label:con.swap,title:con.swap" aria-label="Swap" title="Swap">&#8644;</button>
            <label class="ms-pick"><span data-i18n="con.reference">Reference</span>
              <select id="wfBeside" class="lang-pick" data-lang-ref></select></label>
            <button type="button" class="ghost-btn sm lang-ai" data-lang-translate data-i18n="ai.translate">Translate</button>
          </span>
        </div>
        <div class="sh-word-fields" id="wfWordFields"></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <aside class="sh-side">
      {#- EVENTS / RESOURCES: out while its page is on -#}
      <div class="sh-card wf-panel" data-wf-panel="events resources" hidden>
        <p class="wf-state" id="wfPageState"></p>
        <a class="up-share-link" id="wfPageLink" href="/admin/website/" data-i18n="wf.toPage">Its page → Site Creator › Pages</a>
      </div>

      {#- THE CONTACT FORM: open or not, where it goes, the reasons -#}
      <div class="sh-card wf-panel" data-wf-panel="contact" hidden>
        <button type="button" class="switch" id="wfCtOpen" role="switch" aria-checked="false">
          <span class="switch-track"><span class="switch-state" data-i18n="switch.off">Off</span><span class="switch-knob"></span></span>
          <span class="switch-label"><span data-i18n="sh.live">Live</span></span>
        </button>
      </div>
      <div class="sh-card wf-panel" data-wf-panel="contact" hidden>
        <label class="fld"><span data-i18n="ml.ctTo">Send Messages To</span>
          <input type="email" id="wfCtTo" maxlength="200" placeholder="you@example.org"></label>
        <label class="fld"><span data-i18n="ml.ctFrom">Sent From</span>
          <select id="wfCtFrom"></select></label>
        <div class="ct-topics">
          <span class="sh-lbl" data-i18n="ml.ctTopics">What Is This About</span>
          <div id="wfTopics"></div>
          <button type="button" class="ghost-btn" id="wfAddTopic" data-i18n="ml.ctAddTopic">Add a Reason</button>
        </div>
        <a class="up-share-link" href="/admin/website/?page=contact"
           data-i18n="wf.wordsContact">Its words → Pages › Contact</a>
      </div>

      {#- THE SIGN-UP FORM: out while one of Thauma's lists is on it -#}
      <div class="sh-card wf-panel" data-wf-panel="signup" hidden>
        <span class="sh-lbl" data-i18n="sh.lists">Lists on This Form</span>
        <div class="sh-switches" id="wfLists"></div>
        <a class="up-share-link" href="/admin/website/mail/"
           data-i18n="wf.toMail">Thauma's lists → Mail</a>
      </div>

      {#- How it looks where it is pasted: not saved, part of the code -#}
      <div class="sh-card">
        <label class="sh-pick"><span data-i18n="emb.theme">Background</span>
          <select id="wfTheme">
            <option value="auto" data-i18n="emb.auto">Match Their Page</option>
            <option value="light" data-i18n="emb.light">Always Light</option>
            <option value="dark" data-i18n="emb.dark" selected>Always Dark</option>
          </select>
        </label>
      </div>

      <div class="sh-card">
        <span class="sh-lbl" data-i18n="sh.code">Code to Paste</span>
        <pre class="emb-code" id="wfCode"></pre>
        <button type="button" class="ghost-btn" id="wfCopy" data-i18n="common.copy">Copy</button>
      </div>
    </aside>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="ms-savebar" id="wfBar" role="status" aria-live="polite" hidden>
  <span class="ms-dirty-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
  <span id="wfCount"></span>
  <button type="button" class="ghost-btn" id="wfDiscard" data-i18n="ms.discard">Discard</button>
  <button type="button" class="solid-btn" id="wfSave" data-i18n="sh.save">Save Changes</button>
</div>
